<title>YUGOSLAVIA: BASKETBALL-OLYMPIAKOS WIN BELGRADE TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-OLYMPIAKOS WIN BELGRADE TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympiakos of Greece beat Partizan Belgrade 67-65 (halftime 31-29) to win the Trofej Beograd 96 international basketball tournament on Sunday.</p>
</text>
